      <div class="lp-certs-text">
        <span class="lp-eyebrow">CERTIFICATES</span>
        <h2>Turn Your Knowledge Into Certified Expertise</h2>
        <p>
          Stand out in the job market with validated skills and shareable credentials built on a legacy of trusted education.
        </p>
        <div class="lp-certs-ctas">
          <a href="/test" class="lp-btn lp-btn-primary">Get Certified</a>
          <a href="/certificates" class="lp-btn lp-btn-line">See All Certificates</a>
        </div>
        <div class="lp-verified">Verified credential you can share</div>
