    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6">
      <span class="lp-eyebrow">TEST YOUR SKILLS</span>
      <h2>Practice with Zero to Pro</h2>
      <p>
        Exercises, quizzes and a new coding challenge every week.
      </p>
      <div class="lp-practice-ctas">
        <a href="/test" class="lp-btn lp-btn-primary">📝 Exercises</a>
        <a href="/test" class="lp-btn lp-btn-line">❓ Quizzes</a>
